Package: dsh-desktop
Version: 1.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20.12), npm, curl, ca-certificates, jq, procps, iproute2
Recommends: electron | brave-browser | google-chrome-stable | chromium-browser | chromium
Breaks: dsh-desktop (<< 1.0.0)
XB-Supported-DSH: >= 0.1.5-rc.1 < 0.2.0
Maintainer: RidgeBridgeStudios <RidgeBridgeStudios@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Native desktop launcher for DeepSeek Harness
 Wraps the official @deepseek-ai/dsh runtime in a dedicated,
 sandboxed Electron desktop application window. Supports
 @deepseek-ai/dsh (>= 0.1.5-rc.1, < 0.2.0). Ships a systemd
 user service, initializes the default profile, and launches
 Node with the --expose-internals flag required by the cordis
 HMR plugin (bypassing the NODE_OPTIONS restriction).
